 server upgrades, cloud storage, virtualization, and RAID configurations, the Intel D3-S4510 ensures stable and efficient storage performance in demanding workloads across Bangladesh.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><p><br></p><ul><li>240GB enterprise-grade SSD for server and data center use</li><li>2.5-inch 7mm SATA III (6Gb/s) interface</li><li>Up to 560MB/s read and 280MB/s write speed</li><li>3D TLC NAND for reliability and efficiency</li><li>End-to-end data protection for data integrity</li><li>Power-loss protection to prevent data corruption</li><li>AES 256-bit hardware encryption</li><li>Low power consumption and optimized performance</li><li>High endurance for read-intensive workloads</li></ul>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n  </div>\n\n            </div>\n                                        <div class=\"module-item module-item-4 tab-pane\" id=\"blocks-6afefafb5e2f8-tab-2\">\n                  <div class=\"block-body expand-block\">\n            <div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n      <div class=\"block-content  block-dynamic\">\n                <div class=\"module-compatibility-table\" id=\"tab-compatibility\">\n            <h3>Product List</h3>\n        <div class=\"module-compatibility-table-content\">\n      \n        <div class=\"table-responsive\">\n          <table class=\"table table-bordered\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><strong></strong></td>\n                  <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\"><strong>Price</strong></td>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                                <tr>    \n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-name\"><a href=\"/hpe-900gb-25in-10k-6gbps-enterprise-sas-hard-drive\">HPE 900GB 2.5in 10K 6Gbps Enterprise SAS Hard Drive</a></td>\n                    <td class=\"compatibility-table-price\">\n                        <p class=\"price\"> \n                             \n         